@startuml sequence_diagram_filter
skinparam handwritten true
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rect
skinparam defaultFontName FG Virgil
skinparam shadowing false

actor User as Actor
participant "U I" as UI <<presentation>>
participant BackEnd as BackEnd <<C4 Component>>
database Database

title Read Xpto

Actor --> UI: Read Xpto
activate UI

    UI --> BackEnd: HTTP GET /api/xpto/filter

    activate BackEnd

        BackEnd --> Database: SELECT (query with filters)
        activate Database
            Database -->  BackEnd: xptoList
        deactivate Database

        BackEnd --> UI: HTTP Response

    deactivate BackEnd
UI --> Actor: Show Xpto List
deactivate UI
            
@enduml